  "description": "Salmon Handwritten Font | Cute Japanese Font for Food Branding, Café Menu & Packaging\nMeet Salmon, a cute and friendly handwritten font inspired by cozy Japanese cafés, fresh salmon sushi, and modern food packaging. Its playful handwritten style is perfect for creating eye-catching branding, restaurant menus, café logos, product packaging, labels, stickers, social media graphics, invitations, and printable designs.\nDesigned with a warm handmade feel, Salmon adds a charming personality to every project while remaining clean, readable, and versatile for both digital and print use.\n• TTF, OTF\n• Uppercase A–Z\n• Lowercase a–z\n• Numbers\n• Basic Punctuation",
